---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — CSV Toolbox"
  description="CSV Toolbox is a suite of free, browser-based CSV tools: split, merge, deduplicate and convert. No signup, no uploads, open source."
>
  <div class="container guide">
    <h1>About CSV Toolbox</h1>
    <p>
      CSV Toolbox is a collection of free utilities for everyday CSV work: <a href="/split-csv/">splitting</a>,
      <a href="/merge-csv/">merging</a>, <a href="/remove-duplicates-csv/">deduplicating</a> and
      <a href="/csv-to-json/">converting</a> files.
    </p>
    <p>
      It was built around one principle: <strong>your data should never leave your device</strong>.
      Every tool runs entirely in your browser using client-side processing in background Web Workers.
      There are no servers handling your files, no accounts, no usage limits and no premium tier.
      That design also makes processing fast: local files process without network upload bottlenecks.
    </p>
    <p>
      The project is open source — you can inspect exactly how your files are handled in the
      <a href="https://github.com/Dx1100/csv-toolbox" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">repository on GitHub</a>.
      It is supported by unobtrusive advertising, which keeps every tool free for everyone.
    </p>
    <p>Questions or feature requests? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
